1
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:30,000
Alien Warfare is a action, science fiction,
thriller film directed by Jeremiah Jones.

2
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:54,000
A team of Navy Seals investigates a mysterious science outpost only
to have to combat a squad of powerful alien soldiers.

3
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:18,000
Mike, played by Clayton Snyder.

4
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:42,000
Chris, played by David Meadows.

5
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:06,000
Thorpe, played by Scott C. Roe.

6
00:26:24,000 --> 00:26:30,000
Isabella, played by Larissa Andrade.

7
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:54,000
Jonesy, played by Daniel Washington.

8
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:18,000
Marco, played by Tom DeNucci.

9
00:39:36,000 --> 00:39:42,000
Alien: Earth is an American science fiction horror
television series created by Noah Hawley.

10
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
It is the first television series in the Alien franchise and is set
two years before the events of the 1979 film Alien.

11
00:48:24,000 --> 00:48:30,000
The series stars Sydney Chandler, Alex Lawther, Essie Davis, Samuel Blenkin,
Babou Ceesay, Adarsh Gourav, and Timothy Olyphant in main roles.

12
00:52:48,000 --> 00:52:54,000
Development for the series was reported to have begun in early 2019, with
Ridley Scott attached to executive produce for FX on Hulu.

13
00:57:12,000 --> 00:57:18,000
It had started pre-production by April 2023, with Chandler cast in the lead role the
following month, and further casting taking place from July to November that year.

14
01:01:36,000 --> 01:01:42,000
After principal photography was delayed due to the COVID-19 pandemic, production began
in July 2023 but was halted in August due to the 2023 SAG-AFTRA strike.

15
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
Filming resumed in April 2024 and ended in July that year.

16
01:10:24,000 --> 01:10:30,000
Alien: Earth premiered on FX and FX on Hulu in the United States
and on Disney+ internationally on August 12, 2025.

17
01:14:48,000 --> 01:14:54,000
In November 2025, the series was renewed for a second season.

18
01:19:12,000 --> 01:19:18,000
The film explores themes of alien, u.s. navy seal, outpost, soldiers.

19
01:23:36,000 --> 01:23:42,000
The tone is thought_provoking and intense.
